Subject: [PATCH] linux-firmware: wl12xx- New STA&AP FW support WL128x + Update STA&AP FW for wl127x
Date: Mon, 21 Mar 2011 09:35:33 +0200
Message-Id: <1300692933-13650-1-git-send-email-shahar_levi@ti.com>
Sender: linux-wireless-owner@vger.kernel.org
List-ID: <linux-wireless.vger.kernel.org>

New FW support for WL128x chip:
  STA FW version 7.1.3.50.58
  AP FW version 7.2.0.0.47

Update STA FW for WL127x chip:
  STA FW version 6.1.3.50.58
  AP FW version 6.2.0.0.47

Example NVS files for WL127x and WL128x

Signed-off-by: Shahar Levi <shahar_levi@ti.com>
---

 WHENCE                                             |   24 +++++++++++++++-----
 ti-connectivity/wl1271-fw-2.bin                    |  Bin 273040 -> 273252 bytes
 ti-connectivity/wl1271-fw-ap.bin                   |  Bin 262356 -> 272784 bytes
 ...l1271-nvs.bin => wl1271-nvs-example-wl127x.bin} |  Bin 912 -> 912 bytes
 ti-connectivity/wl1271-nvs-example-wl128x.bin      |  Bin 0 -> 1113 bytes
 ti-connectivity/wl128x-fw-ap.bin                   |  Bin 0 -> 265196 bytes
 ti-connectivity/wl128x-fw.bin                      |  Bin 0 -> 272748 bytes
 7 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)
 rename ti-connectivity/{wl1271-nvs.bin => wl1271-nvs-example-wl127x.bin} (100%)
 create mode 100755 ti-connectivity/wl1271-nvs-example-wl128x.bin
 create mode 100644 ti-connectivity/wl128x-fw-ap.bin
 create mode 100755 ti-connectivity/wl128x-fw.bin

